1) assign_depots(NET, ["D1","D2"], ["C1"]) == {"C1":"D2"}
   Here C1 is equidistant: D1->C1 = 4 (via X), D2->C1 = 4.
2) assign_depots(NET, ["D2","D1"], ["C4","C1"]) == {"C4":"D1","C1":"D2"}
   C4 equidistant (5,5) -> D1; C1 equidistant (4,4) -> D2.

